# Rules for the email assistant

Read `CLAUDE.md` first. It is the source of truth for rules and workflow.
Code patterns (layout, ports and adapters, data access, side effects, HTTP routes): `docs/code-patterns.md`.
Architecture and stack: `docs/architecture.md`. Decisions: `docs/decisions/` (ADR 0011, ADR 0016).
Do not repeat those files here. When they change, this file needs no edit.

## Stack

- Bun workspaces: `apps/server` (Hono), `apps/web` (Astro static build with React islands, Better Auth login), `packages/core` (pure code).
- Postgres 17 (self-hosted), dbmate migrations in `db/migrations/`, Kysely repositories.
- There is no Supabase. Do not add `@supabase/supabase-js`, RLS policies or a `supabase/` folder.
